      "id": "note_biopython",
      "type": "note",
      "position": [
        -240,
        80
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "Biopython Analysis Pipeline\n\nDemonstrates BioNodulo's Biopython, Biostrings, AI sequence classification, and generic HTTP API integration.\n\n1. SeqIO Read: Parse FASTA and export sequence metadata as JSON.\n2. Sequence Stats: Compute GC%, length, and molecular weight.\n3. BLAST Search: Run a local blastn of one sequence against the set.\n4. Translate DNA: Translate coding sequences to protein.\n5. SeqIO Write: Convert parsed sequences to GenBank format.\n6. Biostrings Stats: ORF finding, reverse complement, 6-frame translation (R + Biostrings).\n7. AI Sequence Classification: Classify validated coding sequences with deterministic local fallback.\n8. HTTP API Lookup: Demonstrate a cached, rate-limited UniProt REST query.\n\nData: NCBI 16S rRNA sequences + synthetic bacterial gene fragments."
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Notes",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      }
    },
